WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.683
Every young man reaches a crossroads.

2
00:00:03.683 --> 00:00:08.183
Someone is always waiting there to tell him who he is.

3
00:00:08.183 --> 00:00:16.184
Surrogate Funding makes sure the first voice he hears belongs to a man who has walked that road.

4
00:00:16.184 --> 00:00:19.434
A man in his corner, before the system.

5
00:00:21.034 --> 00:00:24.020
We are built on four pillars.

6
00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:30.817
Faith: a young man who knows his purpose is harder to lead astray.

7
00:00:30.817 --> 00:00:36.069
Family: fathers, mentors, and brothers who show up.

8
00:00:36.069 --> 00:00:44.410
Finances: money skills, a first job, and no small debts that turn into jail time.

9
00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:51.310
Order: discipline, structure, and choosing your circle with wisdom.

10
00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:56.361
Our first program is the Crossroads.

11
00:00:56.361 --> 00:01:02.018
Men who have walked the road, walking beside the next ones.

12
00:01:02.018 --> 00:01:11.318
Every week, young men twelve to twenty-five sit in the circle for straight talk and real stories.

13
00:01:11.318 --> 00:01:17.070
Each one gets a mentor who checks in every week, for a year.

14
00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:18.316
Money skills.

15
00:01:18.316 --> 00:01:19.467
A first job.

16
00:01:19.467 --> 00:01:20.234
A trade.

17
00:01:21.834 --> 00:01:30.953
And when a man is locked up over seventy to three hundred dollars, we bring him home.

18
00:01:30.953 --> 00:01:39.428
No one should lose a job, a home, or their children over a few hundred dollars.

19
00:01:39.428 --> 00:01:48.546
When the case ends, the bail comes back to the fund, and brings the next person home.

20
00:01:48.546 --> 00:01:51.658
Surrogate Funding Foundation.

21
00:01:51.658 --> 00:01:54.983
Be the man in someone's corner.
